{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0034_1000_015siz", "source_sha256": "5e483ad194a6fe942c693ad86b9b507a397348c00599c38041637a7dc3291c71", "ja": "そ……そろそろ、私の出番ですね。\nそれじゃあ、行ってきます。", "zh": "差……差不多轮到我了呢。\n那么我上场了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0034_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5a3a691802afd5b9ecea471f70ec5792b46a97b520c0dcade7bd21b8ea3c265a", "ja": "ああ。いってこい、静香。あまり気負わず、\n今日のステージを思いっきり楽しんでくるといい。", "zh": "嗯，去吧，静香。不用太拘谨，\n尽情享受今天的表演吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0034_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "6b51465b8fbe681b7d9fb5aaf6742fa0d505280257149b2962aaa0e35f385509", "ja": "楽しむって……{$P$}？\nこれは仕事ですよ？　お客さんだっているのに……。", "zh": "你说享受……{$P$}？\n这可是工作喔？而且还有观众在场……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0034_1003_p", "source_sha256": "851d3ecff74533293b7c8288a329fdb0924484060e71ff34d30a06f2bac47701", "ja": "それはそうだけど……でも歌う方が緊張してる\nばかりじゃ、お客さんだって楽しめないだろ？", "zh": "话是这么说没错……但要是唱歌的人紧张个不停，\n观众也无法看得开心吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0034_1004_p", "source_sha256": "939f1b7c963146a71104caf33aac67ddc8476428dd32e1b142e26ded2aaf6784", "ja": "それに、静香が今日まで頑張ってきた事は、\n俺も知ってるからな。だから、心配してないよ。", "zh": "而且我也很清楚静香至今为止都一直很努力，\n所以我一点都不担心喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0034_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "42841507b763be8c4ac051f37fefc587930def8e39c195941748ff6965f78b60", "ja": "そ……そう、ですか。ま、まあ、\nアイドルのプロデューサーなら、当然の仕事ですよね。", "zh": "是……是这样啊。不、不过，\n身为一名偶像制作人，这算是应有的表现吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0034_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "ab918218d0e6c8829315f933b2497b6e74bd678b5dc7f7ccb59e47513bf99c41", "ja": "そういうことなら、まあ……。そもそも、\n心配してもらうようなことなんて何もありませんし。", "zh": "既然你都这么说了，嗯……\n到头来，根本没什么需要担心的事嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0034_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "3dddaff3ae26ddefb487d2f07610e61a702b9a7e7502a62049924c289ab89e21", "ja": "そうですね。\n私も……アイドルらしく、楽しもうと思います。", "zh": "好吧。\n那我也……像个偶像一样，去尽情享受表演好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0034_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "d48e92a2c94adce48111a9c6e3125e78ea8418a99d8b7fc020988358b3e6499b", "ja": "今日のステージは、今日だけのものだから。\n私のすべてを、届けなくちゃ……。", "zh": "因为今天的表演，是只有今天才看得到的。\n我得尽力表现出自己的一切……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0034_1009_p", "source_sha256": "c49ed40e884d695ddc97548c198a1ee42ba2969fc233b9bf00977f16c44ee315", "ja": "だから、そんなに気負わなくても……\nほら、時間だぞ。", "zh": "就说了不用那么拘谨嘛……\n好啦，时间到了喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0034_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "07405ba10296fbe690bb517758e71556885894a3b1025e3465bb33c48e14dfd1", "ja": "あっ……やだ、本当！\nそれじゃ、あの、いってきます！", "zh": "啊……糟糕，真的耶！\n那么，呃，我上场了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0034_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "68e9cbe2adced926ad60cc944f804a8bf4e0757b49775f4cc35102b7b3a1eb93", "ja": "{$P$}！\nさ、サボらないで、ちゃんと見ていてくださいね！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n不、不要偷懒，要好好看着我喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
